sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as WPF / Flutter
  participant DB as Local SQLite
  participant Outbox as Local Outbox
  participant API as .NET API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  UI->>DB: Commit local command + projection
  DB->>Outbox: Persist idempotency key
  Note over UI,Outbox: User sees Pending Sync, not Cloud Confirmed
  Outbox->>API: Upload command batch
  API->>API: Authenticate, authorize, validate, deduplicate
  API->>PG: Transaction + canonical result
  PG-->>API: Commit / conflict
  API-->>Outbox: Accepted / rejected / conflict
  Outbox->>DB: Reconcile projection and cursor
